OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into explosives
OL,4,Alinked to 'extreme right-wing
OL,5,Aterrorism'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe PSNI has said an investigation into
OL,8,Fexplosive devices discovered in Belfast
OL,9,Fat the weekend, is linked to "extreme
OL,10,Fright- wing terrorism".
OL,12,FOn Monday, a 35-year-old man was
OL,13,Fremanded into custody charged with
OL,14,Fstoring explosives and detonators.
OL,16,FWesley Thomas Fletcher is also accused
OL,17,Fof having a consignment of Taser stun
OL,18,Fguns.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
